      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COUNT YOUR CHIPS (2) looked strong on debut September 27 at Temora over 457m (26.27) when boxed wide. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Top prospect. ASTON HURN (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (23.28) at this track behind Turbo Buster in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature again. SUPER SAM (8) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with two wins and a placing from three tries. Placed last time (22.71) at Shepparton in a Mix 6/7 FIN, finishing third and beaten 3 lengths. Looks one of the chances. TIGER PRAWN (5) is an improver in the mix despite missing out at this track when making debut.",
